    "group": "Servants of Change",
    "cp": 1,
    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your Movement phase when one of your INFANTRY or MOUNTED units that is also MUTANT is picked to Advance or Fall Back; that unit is the target. Its ranged attacks gain [ASSAULT] for the rest of the turn, and it stays eligible to shoot and to declare a charge despite that move. The card's phase field says Shooting phase while its timing names your Movement phase, so it does not settle when it is used.",
